    "reasoner_response": "Inform the customer that for their 2021 Ford F150/F250 4WD, the current claim is in "Draft" status, which means the claim is pending submission from their repair facility. Rental benefits will become available only after the claim is authorized. The repair facility must contact the Claims department to initiate and authorize the claim; customers cannot start this process themselves. If the customer has more specific questions about rental coverage or eligibility, ask them to specify so you can provide details. Offer to answer any other rental-related questions they may have.",
    "communication_rules": [
        "- If the customer tried to change the topic while you are waiting for Supervisor instructions, before following any Reasoner's instructions, ask the customer whether they want to switch to the new topic or continue with the current one.",
        "- If any previous requests were prevented from execution, they can now be re-evaluated and executed if appropriate. Make a new function/tool request to do so."
    ]
}
